---
// すべての詳細ページ（学習ログ・記事・実験・ツール・用語・ニュース）で共通のレイアウト
import BaseLayout from './BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import LinkList from '../components/LinkList.astro';
import SourceList from '../components/SourceList.astro';
import type { LinkItem } from '../lib/content';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  eyebrow?: string;
  crumbs: { title: string; path: string }[];
  headings?: { depth: number; slug: string; text: string }[];
  related?: LinkItem[];
  backlinks?: LinkItem[];
  sources?: { type: 'official' | 'tried' | 'discord' | 'ai' | 'other'; title: string; url?: string }[];
  prev?: { title: string; href: string };
  next?: { title: string; href: string };
}
const { title, description, eyebrow, crumbs, headings = [], related = [], backlinks = [], sources = [], prev, next } = Astro.props;
const toc = headings.filter((h) => h.depth === 2 || (h.depth === 1 && headings.filter((x) => x.depth === 2).length === 0));
const relatedIds = new Set(related.map((r) => r.href));
const extraBacklinks = backlinks.filter((b) => !relatedIds.has(b.href));
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <PageHero title={title} eyebrow={eyebrow} crumbs={crumbs}>
    <slot name="hero" />
  </PageHero>
  <div class="container layout-article">
    <article class="article-card">
      <slot name="before" />
      <div class="prose">
        <slot />
      </div>
      <slot name="after" />
      {(prev || next) && (
        <nav class="pager" aria-label="前後のページ">
          {prev ? <a class="card" href={url(prev.href)}><small>← 前へ</small>{prev.title}</a> : <span />}
          {next ? <a class="card next" href={url(next.href)}><small>次へ →</small>{next.title}</a> : <span />}
        </nav>
      )}
    </article>
    <aside class="aside-stack">
      {toc.length > 1 && (
        <nav class="card aside-box toc" aria-label="目次">
          <h2>目次</h2>
          <ol>{toc.map((h) => <li><a href={`#${h.slug}`}>{h.text}</a></li>)}</ol>
        </nav>
      )}
      <section class="card aside-box">
        <h2>情報の見分け方</h2>
        <div class="legend">
          <span class="l-official">公式情報</span>
          <span class="l-tried">実際に試した結果</span>
          <span class="l-member">メンバーの感想</span>
          <span class="l-ai">AIの回答（未検証）</span>
        </div>
      </section>
      <LinkList title="関連ページ" items={related} />
      <LinkList title="このページを参照しているページ" items={extraBacklinks} />
      <SourceList sources={sources} />
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .toc ol { padding-left: 1.3em; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .toc a { color: var(--text); }
  .pager { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .pager a { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; padding: 14px; }
  .pager small { color: var(--muted); }
  .pager .next { text-align: right; }
</style>
